{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:15a400926fbf5dbb38b3c07d97afc4c5071814a64070ed22bc4ed43d536c795a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_b:2_4_005_02_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68882b96ca885f04f2f98d46456ca2058862074e873ba4b71d221b2323a95846",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー。\n刚才包裹送到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_b:2_4_005_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3dcfa79cea8715144b5b269823e5db3827dd8465cf5ad624cc8466194dcc04bb",
      "text": "说是下次录制时要用的鞋子，\n收下真的没问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_b:2_4_005_02_09_b:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:564a623aafd8ce13d5cfba1beddf7e077e1ab6dbf9e58a81e05d22d7f6cb88a8",
      "text": "赞助商坚持希望\n您收下",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_b:2_4_005_02_09_b:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:416dadf87371eec8ca3b3781841a5bea27e7f5d467a829c3501939638a091131",
      "text": "这样啊。能从练习起就用上同样的鞋子很让人感激。\n毕竟鞋子不同的话脚感会大不一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_b:2_4_005_02_09_b:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa546f5ddb3250afe176faebbb7370d2f1853a4d2076d401172798e60dab2a82",
      "text": "已经试穿过\n了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_b:2_4_005_02_09_b:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f9686983932c5bdf5055f627ee6ce9380dd4135a5169aa459d88253ba68bf72",
      "text": "嗯，感觉不坏。\n要是能借此提高射门精度就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:005kao_402_2_4_005_02_09_b:2_4_005_02_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3cf98167565a77ce94889834a3a61c80156dcc67a86c29de0ba834aedbc3d97",
      "text": "离正式录制没多少时间了。\n接下来就更加专心投入练习吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
